{
  "name": "scc",
  "description": "God Hands — extra hands that find, analyze, plan, decompose, benchmark, and improve. The AI workflow that does not skip Check. 16 skills, 19 commands, 17 agents, 10 lifecycle hook events, 3 MCP servers. /scc:godhands gathers, drafts, checks, and cuts.",
